%% ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
%% DIAGRAM 5: RISK MANAGEMENT PROCESS
%% ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

flowchart TD
    R1([Asset Identification]) --> R2[Identify Threats\n& Vulnerabilities]
    R2 --> R3[Score Likelihood\n1=Rare to 5=Almost Certain]
    R3 --> R4[Score Impact\n1=Negligible to 5=Catastrophic]
    R4 --> R5[Calculate Inherent\nRisk = L × I]

    R5 --> R6{Risk Score}
    R6 -->|20-25 CRITICAL| R7["🔴 CRITICAL\nImmediate action\nCISO escalation"]
    R6 -->|10-19 HIGH| R8["🟠 HIGH\nMitigate / Transfer\n30-day SLA"]
    R6 -->|6-9 MEDIUM| R9["🟡 MEDIUM\nControl-based\ntreatment"]
    R6 -->|1-5 LOW| R10["🟢 LOW\nAccept with\nmonitoring"]

    R7 & R8 --> R11[Select Treatment:\nMitigate / Transfer /\nAvoid / Accept]
    R9 & R10 --> R11

    R11 --> R12[Map to ISO 27001\nAnnex A Controls]
    R12 --> R13[Implement Controls\nvia Drata Tasks]
    R13 --> R14[Re-score\nResidual Risk]
    R14 --> R15{Residual Risk\nAcceptable?}
    R15 -->|Yes| R16[Accept & Document\nin Risk Register]
    R15 -->|No| R11

    R16 --> R17[Review Every\n90 Days]
    R17 --> R18([Risk Accepted\nor Closed])

    style R7 fill:#E74C3C,color:#fff
    style R8 fill:#F39C12,color:#fff
    style R9 fill:#2E6DA4,color:#fff
    style R10 fill:#27AE60,color:#fff
